Note on third-party assets.

The MIT licence above covers this repository's own code, data compilation and
documentation. It does NOT cover screenshots, recordings or other media
originating from the projects listed here, which remain the property of their
respective authors and are subject to their own licences.

Assets are copied into `media/` only when a project declares a redistribution
friendly licence (see `PERMISSIVE` in `scripts/media.py`). For every other
project the card links to the upstream asset instead, and the card says so.
If you are the owner of an asset included here and would like it removed,
open an issue and it will be removed.